{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021081457720-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021101119\"/><p>香港仔隧道發生交通意外。</p><p>香港仔隧道發生交通意外。今晨(21日)7時49分，香港仔隧道往灣仔方向的管道內，有兩輛私家車與一輛旅遊巴士發生碰撞，事件中無人傷。往灣仔方向管道一度全線封閉。據網上圖片所見，其中一輛涉事私家車被撞至橫亘兩行車線上。受意外影響附近一帶交通受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T02:59:47.308196+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:14:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:18:07.181509+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:57:53.733039+00:00","content_hash":"dbb43d02e55e37977fe151ffd1c133bcaaf8061d9def87316280e6230c605877","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}